Rizify
======

Rizify is a Milky protocol service built on the Acidify project and its
Yogurt protocol modules.

Upstream projects and attribution
---------------------------------

Acidify
  Repository: https://github.com/LagrangeDev/acidify
  Baseline commit: b8fc6b4fa9a1651d5687ad8bd02de2e3df64e00b
  Modules reused by Rizify:
    - acidify-core
    - acidify-milky
    - yogurt

Yogurt is the upstream protocol service layered on Acidify. Rizify keeps the
upstream source-file copyright and license headers and the upstream LICENSE
file.

