External signing boundary
-------------------------

Rizify does not implement, copy, bundle, or reverse engineer the QQ signing
algorithm. It does not depend on wrapper.node. Signature operations are
delegated to an external LagrangeSignServer V2 instance over HTTP:

  POST /api/sign/sec-sign

The external sign server is not part of this repository and is not modified
by Rizify.
